OL,3,GNEWSASouth East Water worst for supply
OL,4,A- how do the rest fare?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth East Water is the worst in the
OL,7,Findustry for supply issues, a new
OL,8,Freport says.
OL,10,FThe company saw its average minutes of
OL,11,Fsupply lost per property it serves
OL,12,Fincrease sixfold compared to 2024,
OL,13,Faccording to the first joint report by
OL,14,Fthe regulators.
OL,16,FSouthern Water and Thames Water also
OL,17,Fperformed badly on their environmental
OL,18,Fperformance.
OL,20,FSpokespeople for the water companies
OL,21,Fsay they had made progress on
OL,22,Fperformance.
